204 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 50 0 R
/T (The space presents multiple layers of barrier condition. The IC17 carriageway runs immediately adjacent, reinforced by metal grates that physically seal the corridor edge. A small watercourse runs between the space and the highway, which presents no vegetation beyond sparse low-growing plants, reflecting a condition of ecological suppression rather than ecological presence. The only existing crossing promotes car flow, further reinforcing the automotive character of the immediate environment.)
/E (The space presents multiple layers of barrier condition. The IC17 carriageway runs immediately adjacent, reinforced by metal grates that physically seal the corridor edge. A small watercourse runs between the space and the highway, which presents no vegetation beyond sparse low-growing plants, reflecting a condition of ecological suppression rather than ecological presence. The only existing crossing promotes car flow, further reinforcing the automotive character of the immediate environment.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [16]
>>
