/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 51 0 R
/T (The space has the unique capacity to mediate between the most active urban edge of the municipality - the commercial street, the Metro station, and the dense residential fabric to the north - and the more vulnerable and underserviced communities of Senhor Roubado and the AUGI zones to the south. Its position at the convergence of two major corridors makes it the only space in the municipality capable of operating simultaneously as a north-south connector, an east-west ecological bridge, and a civic anchor at metropolitan scale.)
/E (The space has the unique capacity to mediate between the most active urban edge of the municipality - the commercial street, the Metro station, and the dense residential fabric to the north - and the more vulnerable and underserviced communities of Senhor Roubado and the AUGI zones to the south. Its position at the convergence of two major corridors makes it the only space in the municipality capable of operating simultaneously as a north-south connector, an east-west ecological bridge, and a civic anchor at metropolitan scale.)
