/P 51 0 R
/T (The barrier condition here is not a single line but a system, an accumulation and  diverging carriageways that surrounds and subdivides the central space into a series of enclosed sub-zones, each difficult to access and impossible to read as part of a whole. The magnitude of the infrastructural geometry effectively renders the space inaccessible from all sides simultaneously, with total enclosure produced not by a wall but by the sheer scale and complexity of the node.)
