/T (The space is physically enclosed by metal grates along its edges, with the IC18 carriageway and the EN250 forming its northern and eastern limits. The topography of the space slightly elevated in relation to its surroundings, combined with the presence of the watercourse and periodic flooding, further reinforces its inaccessibility. The sheer scale of the space also contributes to its barrier condition: its extent makes it hard to cross or navigate without dedicated infrastructure.)
