/T (The latent connectivity of this space is present but hard to define. The surrounding AUGI fabric is fragmented and underserviced, The watercourse and the dam that maintains the flooding condition signal a hydrological system outside its own boundaries. The dense vegetation to the south represents a exception in almost all of Odivelas, yet the area has low expression of it within itself. The crossing under the highway is the only point of transversal negotiation, however limited and obsolete.)
