/Title (The space presents multiple layers of barrier condition. The IC17 carriageway runs immediately adjacent, reinforced by metal grates that physically seal the corridor edge. A small watercourse runs between the space and the highway, which presents no vegetation beyond sparse low-growing plants, reflecting a condition of ecological suppression rather than ecological presence. The only existing crossing promotes car flow, further reinforcing the automotive character of the immediate environment.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1525 0 R
/Prev 1595 0 R
/Next 1695 0 R
>>
endobj
1653 0 obj
